{"words": [{"text": "وَلِلْمُطَلَّقَـٰتِ", "translation": "And for the divorced women"}, {"text": "مَتَـٰعٌۢ", "translation": "(is) a provision"}, {"text": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۖ", "translation": "in a fair manner "}, {"text": "حَقًّا", "translation": "a duty"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translation": "the righteous"}], "sahih": "And for divorced women is a provision according to what is acceptable - a duty upon the righteous."}